# 5BSD: jail rule option, by name, by jid, lists, ranges, with user
pass in proto tcp to port 22 jail web
pass out proto udp jail 0
pass in proto tcp jail { web, db }
pass in proto tcp jail 3:7
pass in proto tcp jail > 10
block in proto tcp jail != web
pass out proto tcp user root jail web
block in inet proto { tcp, udp } jail parent.child
